silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_slug_as_authority_face_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In '02SlugasauthorityfaceYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In the Music graph engine entry section 02_slug_as_authority_face, the music_typed_leg_4 arrow witnesses the Mittens microchip-id arrow witnessing identifier-by-leg, distinct from identifier-as-Mittens." .
